  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Towards a Holistic Approach to Labour Migration Governance and Labour Mobility in North Africa (THAMM)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Project is designed as a regional programme to foster legal migration and mobility for North Africa countries. The programme addresses both the South-South dimension of labour migration and mobility through regional dialogue and cooperation (ILO-IOM components) as well as mobility aspects from North African countries to Europe.</narrative>
  </description>
